# Root build context (used by mcp/Dockerfile and Dockerfile.spa).
# Keep: server/vantage_server, mcp/vantage_mcp, index.html, app.js, app.css,
# ds/, vendor/. Exclude everything heavy or secret.
**/.venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info/
.git/
logs/
initiatives/
specs/
src/
data/
server/data-local/
server/tests/
mcp/tests/
**/.robinhood_token.json
*.bak-*
